# Wave log for the DataFusion-removal program (.wave-log.jsonl).
# Append-only, one JSON object per wave of agents: what was launched, what
# landed, what died, and the measured oracle readings either side. Exists so
# future wave estimates come from recorded throughput rather than from memory —
# every estimate in this program that came from recall has been wrong.
# Machine- and session-specific, so it is not source.
/.wave-log.jsonl
